<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 60, left: 60, width: '1160px', height: '64px', background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>创新二：把决策过程显式呈现给使用者</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F5' }}>03 · Transparency</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 148, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ padding: '12px 18px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        界面「Agent 工作台」实时渲染角色卡与决策卡：第几次决策、它在想什么、调了什么工具、工具返回了什么、因此说了什么。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: '276px', padding: '14px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '10px', height: '10px', background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>面试官</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>主持对话：追问、深挖、换题、收尾</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '276px', padding: '14px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '10px', height: '10px', background: '#D9534F' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>评估官</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>逐题复核并修正评分（限幅 ±15 分）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '276px', padding: '14px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '10px', height: '10px', background: '#8B97A8' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>陪练官</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>生成一周计划与针对性练习题</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '276px', padding: '14px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '10px', height: '10px', background: '#8B97A8' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>出题官</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>按岗位 JD 定制题目与考察点</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, background: '#F7F9FC' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>决策卡示例（真实运行输出）</Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: '96px' }}>第 3 次决策</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>思考：候选人把线程池答成了 HashMap，先礼貌拉回来，重新问 HashMap 的核心结构</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: '96px' }}>调用工具</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>analyze_answer → 命中 0 个考察点、深度 2、判定为「答偏」</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: '96px' }}>因此说出</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>「我注意到你讲到的是线程池 —— 我们回到 HashMap，它底层到底是什么结构？」</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>面镜 MockMirror · AI 模拟面试与能力提升软件</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>08 / 20</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
